| HTTP Method | Route                | Description                                                | Role Required | Request Body                                      | Expected Response                                                                                          |
| ----------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| POST        | `/api/auth/register` | Registers a new user as an Organiser or Participant.       | None          | FirstName, LastName, Email, Password, Phone, Role | **201 Created** with user details; **400 Bad Request** for invalid data; **409 Conflict** if email exists. |
| POST        | `/api/auth/login`    | Authenticates a user and creates an authenticated session. | None          | Email, Password                                   | **200 OK** with user/session information; **401 Unauthorized** for invalid credentials.                    |
| POST        | `/api/auth/logout`   | Ends the current authenticated session.                    | Any           | None                                              | **200 OK** confirming logout; **401 Unauthorized** if not logged in.                                       |
